  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Communications Support to Government of Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project offers HMG the chance to gain frontline experience in addressing misinformation and disinformation within private messaging groups, an area of growing importance and influence.

The aim is to identify opportunities for the Government of Sierra Leone to enhance their communications expertise, reach rural audiences, and address domestic misinformation and disinformation.</narrative>
  </description>
